  "ending": {
    "unlockAfter": 3,
    "acts": [
      {
        "image": "images/water-lily-pond.jpg",
        "alt": {
          "zh": "莫奈《睡莲池》1899，伦敦国家美术馆",
          "en": "Claude Monet, The Water-Lily Pond, 1899, The National Gallery, London"
        },
        "caption": {
          "zh": "1899年 · 伦敦国家美术馆",
          "en": "1899 · The National Gallery, London"
        },
        "kicker": "ACT I",
        "title": {
          "zh": "第一幕 · 一座为了画画的花园",
          "en": "A garden made for painting"
        },
        "text": {
          "zh": "1893年，莫奈在吉维尼家旁边买下一块地，建了一座水上花园，“既为了悦目，也为了有东西可画”。他扩大池塘，种满新奇的睡莲。1895年，他在池塘最窄处建了这座桥，同年就开始画它。",
          "en": "In 1893, Monet bought land next to his house in Giverny and created a water garden \"both for the pleasure of the eye and for the purpose of having subjects to paint\". He enlarged the pond and filled it with exotic water lilies. In 1895 he built this bridge at the neck of the pond, and began painting it that same year."
        }
      },
      {
        "image": "images/water-lily-pond.jpg",
        "alt": {
          "zh": "莫奈《睡莲池》1899，伦敦国家美术馆",
          "en": "Claude Monet, The Water-Lily Pond, 1899, The National Gallery, London"
        },
        "caption": {
          "zh": "1899年 · 伦敦国家美术馆",
          "en": "1899 · The National Gallery, London"
        },
        "kicker": "ACT II",
        "title": {
          "zh": "第二幕 · 十七种光",
          "en": "Seventeen kinds of light"
        },
        "text": {
          "zh": "1899年，花园已经长成。莫奈在不同的光线下，画了这个主题的17个视角。伦敦这一幅，是其中之一。",
          "en": "By 1899 the garden had matured. Monet painted 17 views of this motif under different light. The London painting is one of them."
        }
      },
      {
        "image": "images/water-lily-pond.jpg",
        "alt": {
          "zh": "莫奈《睡莲池》1899，伦敦国家美术馆",
          "en": "Claude Monet, The Water-Lily Pond, 1899, The National Gallery, London"
        },
        "caption": {
          "zh": "1899年 · 伦敦国家美术馆",
          "en": "1899 · The National Gallery, London"
        },
        "kicker": "ACT III",
        "title": {
          "zh": "第三幕 · 越来越接近抽象",
          "en": "Towards abstraction"
        },
        "text": {
          "zh": "这座水上花园成了他晚年最着迷的东西，一共画了大约250幅。后来的池塘越来越接近抽象，但1899年这一幅，仍然扎根在看得见的现实里。",
          "en": "The water garden became the obsession of his later career, the subject of some 250 paintings. His later ponds grew almost abstract, but this 1899 version still feels anchored in visible reality."
        }
      }
    ],
    "final": {
      "zh": "为了有东西可画，他造了一座花园。",
      "en": "He made a garden so that he would have something to paint."
    },
